<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Apr 11.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Apr 11.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1415 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat 11 pct protein to Middland May 114.00</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Suffolk Apr 99.50</p>
<p>West Norfolk Jul 105.40</p>
<p>Liverpool Jun 103.00</p>
<p>Norfolk/Suffolk Jul 106.00/06.75/06.50</p>
<p>Tilbury Apr 99 to 100</p>
<p>East Anglia Jun 103.00</p>
<p>Feed barley to Southampton Apr 100.50</p>
<p>Yorkshire Jan/Mar 104.50</p>
</text>
